00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:24,710
So that's where we're trying to block that.

00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:38,710
But certainly, if you're doing radiation therapy, you could use that. We also have another holopath from PHP called RADOLIN, RADOLIN or ADYLI or something like that.

00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:43,710
